# BPB Website — tooltip module

## API

- `ItemTooltip.render(item)` → element
- `ItemTooltip.mount(container, item)` → mounts into a node/selector
- Keep renderer in `js/shared/tooltip.js` + `tooltip.css`
- Floating hover/focus: `createTooltipHover()` from `js/shared/tooltip-hover.js` (load classic `tooltip.js` before page modules)

## Item shape (frontend)

```js
{
  id, name, rarity, type, class,
  extraTypes, // array
  cost,
  effect,     // tagged plain text, NOT HTML
  image, shape // optional
}
```

## Effect text

- Use tags like `<Vampirism>`, `<Star>`, `<Effect>` for icons
- Blank line between ability blocks
- Numbers / `+n` / `n%` are styled by the renderer
- Do not store pre-built HTML in `effect`

## Rules

- One shared tooltip for all items — data changes, not new tooltip HTML files
- Rarity drives frame art; keep crop/divider behavior centralized in CSS/JS
- When loading from Supabase, map `extra_types` → `extraTypes` first
